# Loaded by Vite in every mode (dev, build, preview) as the baseline
# default. Safe to commit: it's just the local backend URL, not a secret.
#
# On Vercel, set VITE_API_BASE_URL in Project Settings -> Environment
# Variables (Production scope) to the real deployed backend URL - Vite
# treats an env var already present in process.env (which is how Vercel
# injects dashboard-configured variables into the build) as taking
# precedence over this file, so no code change or redeploy-time edit here
# is needed to point production at the real backend.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
